// REFERENCE DETECTION — NOT A PRODUCTION ANALYTIC RULE
//
// Purpose:
// Illustrates how a centralized SIEM could identify storage resources
// that may not meet an enterprise customer-managed-key requirement.
//
// Architecture dependency:
// AWS and OCI telemetry must first be ingested and normalized into
// Microsoft Sentinel. That ingestion pipeline is outside the implemented
// scope of this repository.
//
// This query is intentionally illustrative because encryption properties,
// schemas, and event structures vary by cloud and ingestion method.

// Azure example: identify successful storage configuration activity
// requiring validation against the organization's encryption standard.
AzureActivity
| where ActivityStatusValue == "Success"
| where OperationNameValue has "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts"
| project
    TimeGenerated,
    Cloud = "Azure",
    Caller,
    OperationNameValue,
    ResourceGroup,
    Resource,
    SubscriptionId
